  "short_description": "Cozy 1930s summer cabin with wood-burning fireplace, new Trex deck, and dog-friendly policy.",
  "full_description": "1930's Rustic Summer Cabin in Quaint Green Mountain Falls. Two bedroom and 1 bath Cabin is perfect for 1 to 4 adults, or 2 adults with 2 or 3 children. The living room leather sofa could handle guest #5 if needed. Escape to the peace and quiet of mountain life with many tourist attractions less than 30 minutes away.\n\nThis summer cabin Living Room has a wood burning fireplace as well as baseboard heat. The get-away cabin location has spotty cell phone service, Direct TV service and Wi-fi is available in the cabin (May through October) plus there are lots of movies for your family's viewing pleasure.\n\nEnjoy the deck and the wildlife that is abundant. Escape to the peace and quiet of mountain life with many tourist attractions less than 30 minutes away.\n\nNote: Dogs only are allowed. This is a small cabin so only one large dog, or two small dogs preferred.",
